  "stageId": "act17d0_st03",
  "title": "Trekking Upon Terra",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "855fb89636595d468fef535b8e62387814d01245613e778d20ff5fd06f556e7e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half a month later"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you for all you've done, Cohen, Kötz, Tina, Alexsandr."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On behalf of... The town of Long Spring..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm not so good with this kind of formal language."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thanks to you, I survived the conflict with my brother, and my people were able to return to live on their land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "We were only doing what had to be done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "We started this, so it's our responsibility to end it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If it weren't for my irredeemable brother, none of this would've happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I would have liked to offer you a reward."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, as you can see, our town has been destroyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anything we have left, I want used to rebuild Long Spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A cash reward... is beyond my power to give you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But anything you may want from this home is yours to take."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think we will have to tear it all down and build a new Long Spring with the survivors."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "About that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Alexsandr?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "This helmet fits well. Can I keep it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Uh huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Really, the nail tips are so blindingly bright, I'd like to put one on my shield so I don't need batteries anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "That's enough for us. We're satisfied."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's... that's all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My weapons, my father's heirlooms, you can—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "No thanks. You need them more than we do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Picale",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Let's go. We should leave now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mister Kötz......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_155_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're finally done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Did you say goodbye to the Lord?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Then it's time for us to go too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My team will cover your return to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Cohen, your squad is coming with us, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Right. We've been fighting too long. We need a place to rest and resupply."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "And most importantly, we probably need some identities."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Identities we can go around the world with... around Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The car's ready. We're off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Your information has been registered with Rhodes Island. You may stay and resupply at Rhodes Island field offices, or safehouses across Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Although you are not official employees of Rhodes Island, the mission network is open to you and you will be paid for contracts you complete."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "That's about it. Is there anything else you'd like to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Just real quick, I have to ask, does Rhodes Island have any sci-fi literature?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Human Resources Operator",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "I'm sorry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So these are our new identities."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least I've got a shield I can use. Could be worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do we have a plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Try to take a look at this world, which we now know too little about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd like to have a detailed writeup myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But this time, I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's all up to us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So where's our first destination?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Somewhere called Siesta. Sounds like a pretty good city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then let's get going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Until we make it back home, we're on the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
